        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.6151123046875,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "exposure to TB disease and who were rapidly placed on ART and monitored carefully every month for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991947174072266,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        79.31470489501953,
        527.4069213867188,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "(34) new exposure to TB or emergence of TB disease . Few RCTs included children on ART. In one trial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.462890625,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "of 167 children on ART, the incidence of TB was lower in those given TPT than in those who were not,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        105.71472930908203,
        527.4227905273438,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "(35) but the difference was not statistically significant (incidence rate ratio 0.51, 95% CI 0.15; 1.75)  . A",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        118.91474151611328,
        476.9012756347656,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "(36) cohort study suggested an additive protective effect of TPT in children receiving ART  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4537353515625,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "For infants with HIV aged < 12 months, the GDG recommended that TPT be given only to those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.443115234375,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "who have a history of household contact with a person with TB and are considered not to have TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.1657104492188,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "disease according to investigations conducted in line with national guidelines, because of limited data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981484413146973,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.3958740234375,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "on the benefits. The GDG strongly recommended TPT for children aged ≥ 12 months with HIV but",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.4003295898438,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "without clinical manifestations suggestive of TB disease, despite the low certainty of the evidence,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4454345703125,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "because of the clear benefits seen in adults with HIV and the high risk for TB disease among people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4354858398438,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "with HIV. Children ≥ 12 months with HIV who have clinical manifestations or who are contacts should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        420.8143005371094,
        234.29469299316406,
        445.4653015136719,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 1",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        451.0116882324219,
        248.7377471923828
      ],
      "text": "). be evaluated further and treated for TB disease or TBI as indicated (see also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        255.99867248535156,
        527.3663330078125,
        270.4416809082031
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted that, although the evidence for the efficacy of TPT in children on ART is limited, it is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        269.19854736328125,
        527.4002685546875,
        283.6415710449219
      ],
      "text": "biologically plausible, given the evidence of additive effects in adults with HIV receiving ART. Thus,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        282.3985595703125,
        437.7575988769531,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "TPT is recommended for children, regardless of whether they are on ART or not.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86614990234375,
        304.10247802734375,
        527.4334716796875,
        318.5455017089844
      ],
      "text": "Despite limited evidence on the value of TPT in children with HIV after successful completion of TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        316.0264892578125,
        527.5341796875,
        331.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "(20) treatment  , the GDG considered that children with HIV who are at risk of reinfection could benefit",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.999350547790527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.5025939941406,
        527.4365234375,
        344.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "from TPT. Therefore, the GDG conditionally recommended that all children with HIV who have been",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.7024841308594,
        527.4014282226562,
        358.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "successfully treated for TB and are living in settings with high TB transmission as defined by national",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.902587890625,
        164.76210021972656,
        371.3456115722656
      ],
      "text": "authorities (see also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        164.9499053955078,
        356.9026184082031,
        213.19590759277344,
        371.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "Definitions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        213.19850158691406,
        356.9026184082031,
        527.4423217773438,
        371.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": ") may receive a course of TPT. This can be started immediately after",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        370.10260009765625,
        428.30059814453125,
        384.545654296875
      ],
      "text": "judgement. the last dose of TB curative treatment or later, according to clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        394.9691162109375,
        472.69305419921875,
        413.2391357421875
      ],
      "text": "Household contacts of people with TB, regardless of HIV status",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41629791259766,
        433.3016052246094,
        513.4007568359375,
        447.74462890625
      ],
      "text": "5. Children aged < 5 years who are household contacts of people with bacteriologically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41429901123047,
        446.5016174316406,
        513.6412963867188,
        460.94464111328125
      ],
      "text": "confirmed pulmonary TB and who are found not to have TB disease on an appropriate clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41429901123047,
        459.70159912109375,
        513.3366088867188,
        474.1446228027344
      ],
