    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41429901123047,
        546.129638671875,
        449.3095703125,
        561.8486328125
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, low certainty of the estimates of effect) treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        591.3243408203125,
        236.09176635742188,
        609.5942993164062
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        615.024169921875,
        527.402587890625,
        630.7431640625
      ],
      "text": "(17,37) Recommendation 5 recommendation 6  was initially published by WHO in 2015 and   in 2018  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.965445518493652,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.5001831054688,
        527.4450073242188,
        643.9431762695312
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review conducted for the 2015 guidelines on household contacts in countries with a TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.42431640625,
        442.1580810546875,
        657.143310546875
      ],
      "text": "(37–39) incidence > 100/100 000 population was updated in 2018   (see PICO 1 in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        442.0010986328125,
        642.7003173828125,
        479.3822937011719,
        657.143310546875
      ],
      "text": "Annex 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        479.3837890625,
        642.7003173828125,
        527.423828125,
        657.143310546875
      ],
      "text": "). The aim",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        655.9002075195312,
        527.40234375,
        670.3432006835938
      ],
      "text": "of the review was to determine the prevalence of TBI, progression to TB disease and the cumulative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.1002197265625,
        527.5606689453125,
        683.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "prevalence of TB among household contacts, stratified by age. Another 19 studies published between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977126121520996,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.3001708984375,
        527.4047241210938,
        696.7431640625
      ],
      "text": "2014 and 2016 were added. While the evidence reviewed related to HIV-negative child contacts,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.5001831054688,
        527.5460815429688,
        709.9431762695312
      ],
      "text": "children with HIV who are household contacts of a person with bacteriologically confirmed pulmonary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969959259033203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        708.7003173828125,
        370.630615234375,
        723.143310546875
      ],
      "text": "TB should also undergo investigation and treatment as necessary.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        730.4041748046875,
        527.3936767578125,
        744.84716796875
      ],
      "text": "The prevalence of TBI was higher among adolescents aged > 15 years and adults than in children",
